    "title": "Accounting Records and Financial Statements",
  },
  {
    "explanatoryNote": "A large strata scheme, or a scheme whose annual budget exceeds the prescribed amount, must have its accounts and financial statements audited; optional for other schemes.",
    "resolutionCategory": "ORDINARY",
    "resolutionText": "The Owners - Strata Plan No. {{PLAN_NUMBER}} RESOLVES by ordinary resolution to appoint an auditor to review the accounts and financial statements of the owners corporation for the coming financial year.",
