    "CLOSED": "Finalise and close the debt recovery case. Record the outcome and any relevant notes for future reference.",
    "COMMITTEE_REVIEW": "Present the case to the strata committee for review and decision on next steps. The committee must resolve to proceed with legal recovery.",
    "ENFORCEMENT": "Enforce the court order or NCAT decision. This may include registration of a judgment, garnishee orders, or other enforcement mechanisms.",
    "FINAL_NOTICE": "Issue a final notice of the overdue contribution, warning that further recovery action will be taken if payment is not received within 14 days.",
    "HARDSHIP_REVIEW": "Review any hardship application from the lot owner. Consider whether a payment plan or alternative arrangement is appropriate before escalating.",
    "INITIAL_CONTACT": "Make initial contact with the lot owner to advise them of the overdue levy and request payment. This is an informal reminder before formal notices.",
    "LEDGER_VERIFICATION": "Verify the accuracy of all levy charges, payments received and the outstanding balance. Ensure the ledger is reconciled before proceeding.",
    "LEGAL_REFERRAL": "Refer the matter to the scheme's solicitor for formal debt recovery proceedings. Provide all supporting documentation and correspondence.",
    "PROCEEDINGS": "Commence formal legal proceedings. This may include an application to NCAT or the Local Court for recovery of the outstanding levy debt.",
    "REMINDER_NOTICE": "Issue a formal reminder notice under s.83(1) of the Strata Schemes Management Act 2015. The notice must specify the amount owing and due date.",
  },
  "HARDSHIP_INFORMATION": {
